                            "last_played": 1791992921
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Unplayable on modern monitors unless you want to set your screens to potato resolution or sit with your face a few inches from your monitors. The HUD/UI doesn't scale, so the fonts, icons, etc. are microscopic (2560x1440 monitors). Font pack didn't fix the problems and I haven't seen a mod that appears to fix the problem. I'm not willing to futz with the resolution on my dual screen setup just to run this in full screen borderless mode at a 20th century resolution. I really, really have been wanting to play this, but didn't get past the first couple tutorial steps because I had no idea how fast I was going except for the praise from the tutorial voice",
